  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Mental Mutation</strong></p><p>Your head has become a lodestone for electricity and arcs of lightning flicker around you in an alarming way and leap from your eyes in an alarming way. You can, with a successful <strong>Opposed Willpower</strong> vs <strong>Toughness</strong> Test, emit an electric charge that gives a @Condition[Stunned] Condition to a person you touch. If you are in combat you must succeed with a <strong>Melee (Brawling)</strong> Test to touch them first. With a <strong>Challenging (+0) Willpower</strong> you can send a crackling lightning bolt from your head or eyes to a target within Willpower Bonus yards. The damage is determined by your Willpower Bonus +SL and the attack inflicts 1 @Condition[Blinded] Condition as well. Metal armour does not protect against the damage. Fumbling a Test to use this mutation causes a @Table[minormis]{Minor Miscast}.</p>"
    },
